stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Backlog: Issue created and triaged
    Backlog --> Ready: Owner, priority, milestone and acceptance criteria
    Ready --> InProgress: Branch and pull request opened
    InProgress --> InReview: Review requested and CI starts
    InReview --> InProgress: Changes requested
    InReview --> Done: Approved, CI green and merged to dev
    Done --> Blocked: Regression found after merge
    Blocked --> Ready: Reopened with a fix plan
    Done --> [*]

    state "Backlog" as Backlog
    state "Ready" as Ready
    state "In progress" as InProgress
    state "In review" as InReview
    state "Done" as Done
    state "Blocked" as Blocked

    note right of Done
        Only Sergio merges into main.
        A release is cut from main, not from dev.
    end note
